%% draw-visual:
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P0 as CLI
  participant P1 as agent-plane
  participant P2 as PostgreSQL
  participant P3 as VM a
  participant P4 as VM b
  Note over P0,P4: agent-plane restarts, database and guests kept running
  P1->>P2: read unfinished
  P2->>P1: a: X1, b: Y1
  P1-xP3: inspect X1
  Note over P1: a unreachable: X1 uncertain
  P1->>P4: identity? inspect Y1
  P4->>P1: same boot, Y1 running
  P1->>P2: b reconciled
  Note over P1: reopen admission for b only
  P0->>P1: inspect a, b
  P1->>P0: a stale, b ready
  P1-xP3: bounded retry
  P1->>P4: poll Y1 output
  P4->>P1: output, exit 0
